    "ix.23": "Physical regions of Texas & geographic factors in settlement — Surface map work, Deep concept map",
    "ix.24": "Adapting to & modifying the environment — Deep concept map, Transfer inquiry",
    "ix.25": "Economic activities of early American Indian groups — Surface jigsaw, Deep sources",
